            "review_text": "Ivan D\n16 contributions\n0\nGreat little hideout!\nJun 2016 • Family\nRestaurant is off beaten path in an alley. The Hue style food is absolutely delicious. The prices are very reasonable. We ordered 2 of every appetizer (for 3 families) and they were all very tasty. The snails are the best I've had on this trip. For large groups, reservations needed.\nWritten June 7, 2016",
