            "review_title": "Review at Kim Long Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tom V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam122 contributions\n0\nThe Snails Are Delicious\nApr 2015 • Friends\nTucked away near the end of small alley on the outskirts of district 3, Kim Long has been my favorite for a long time. Small and narrow, the place has the dark carved wood of imperial Viet Nam many generations ago.\n\nThe menu is limited, however everything is Hue food and everything is delicious.\n\nLast time I tried the snails with lemongrass. These were the best snails I have ever had in Viet Nam.\n\nA little bit of the beaten track and hard to get to, the place has a nice atmosphere and good service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 8, 2015",
