            "review_text": "MadsMonsen\nHanoi, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nFavourite Hue place in District 3\nOct 2014 • Family\nWe frequent Kim Long on a regular basis as they have reasonable prices and good food. The restaurant is decorated in Hue style and they have upgraded the main dining area to have aircon. A small outdoor area, one table, is located outside in the garden area that consist of a miniature waterfall, Buddha statues and Hue elements. It's generally a quiet place that gets busy around lunch and dinner time, they stay open late and offer take away service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 23, 2014",
